			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Shani makes an app's notifications wait.

Swipe a notification to the left and tap Shani, next to Clear. Or hold the notification down and choose Shani among its actions. It works on the Lock Screen too. That app is then on Shani's list: its notifications are kept back, without banner, sound or screen wake, for the time set below, and come up when the time is over.

On a notification of an app that is being silenced the button says Shani Off.</string>
