			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>With Each New Notification: the app stays on the list. Its next notification starts the clock; that one and everything else the app sends meanwhile are kept back and come up together when the time is over. The notification after that starts a new round. So a noisy app reaches you at most once per round.

When I Tap Shani: the tap silences the app once, from that moment. When the time is over the kept notifications come up, and the app notifies as usual until you tap Shani on it again. It stays in Apps &amp; Log, and its notifications go on being logged.</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>When the Silence Starts</string>
		</dict>
