			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>One Alert: everything that was kept comes up; only the newest one sounds and shows a banner, the others go straight to the list.

Alert for Each: every one arrives the way it would have, one after another.

Silently: all of them go to the list, no sound, no banner.

Log Only: they are never shown and are removed; you find them in the app's log.

Critical alerts are never kept back.</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>When the Time Is Over</string>
